  "body": "## Why this change is needed\n\nThe pinned Android preferences plugin can expose its native in-memory value after a failed synchronous commit. Reloading the Dart cache and comparing payloads must therefore not acknowledge a Memory save or a previously known wallet reward without a positive platform write response.\n\nA failed Connect Four bot save could leave the paused board without a scheduled retry; a completed move whose reward failed could similarly leave the result flow unfinished. The actual Android tour in run 43626348513 also exhausted its existing preview-observation deadline in general OCR fallbacks on a fading frame.\n\n## Resulting behavior\n\n- Memory explicitly confirms validated native-cache snapshots with a positive same-value platform write at adoption and recovery, retaining owner queues, profile guards, save keys and game rules.\n- All three existing wallet reward-ID deduplication paths require a positive persistence response without adding another reward or emitting another wallet change.\n- Connect Four re-arms failed bot actions on its paused clock. A saved terminal move retries only its existing idempotent reward/receipt. Result display uses the same pause and fresh owner/generation guards.\n- Only the exact Kart preview caption uses the narrow fast whole-image OCR reader. Two fresh observed frames, exact text and stable bounds, real input and the unchanged 55-second deadline remain required. Downstream race, HUD, driving, save and return gates are unchanged.\n\n## Exact current source\n\nHead `8e64f27c86e1704fa65dfe9ef9c8b2217f9f0a11`, tree `84b2103328a1b385a0d3c7c1b17f7d7329252da0`; native stays `29080ef8cd1a5b385eeeec97976fbefd31280427`, version 0.13.8+2020.\n\nThe original implementation commit `e2db0d60af51266caa9b54ffd08eb0947ae99ac6` changes nine entries from Studio28462 (six modifications, three added regression files), preserving 4,363 earlier leaves. Successor `0d7e6e5efb1fe8cd2e9a7f92cdd4034b81173304` fixes two guarded interface-call casts. Current `8e64` changes only three existing test files; all 4,369 other leaves and every production source remain identical to 0d7e. All exact source blobs and complete recursive trees were checked before leased, non-forced ref updates.\n\n## Actual verification and retained failures\n\n- **25 Python cases actually passed locally**: 23 existing cases unchanged plus two focused preview-reader cases. Actual OCR replay on two unchanged Android PNGs preserves the faded negative result and recognizes the clear caption in its observed bounds; this offline replay sends no touch and is not an Android PASS.\n- **45 new Flutter cases are prepared**: Memory 25, wallet 14, Connect Four 6. No successful execution is claimed yet.\n- [First Feature run 43632642356](https://github.com/Ullmann27/lumo-lernen/actions/runs/43632642356) failed before Flutter tests on two actual Dart type errors. The guarded-cast successor fixes those compiler errors.\n- [0d7e Feature run 43633267932](https://github.com/Ullmann27/lumo-lernen/actions/runs/43633267932): Android host compilation and separate Memory/Scheduler/Quiz source contracts succeeded. Flutter analysis has zero errors; focused regressions report **23 passed / 7 failed**. Full-suite and all 45 new cases were not run.\n- Current test-only successor checks the extra complete identical positive ACK, unchanged result/balance/IDs and absence of extra reward emissions. Memory load confirmation is checked separately from ordered user writes; deferred test gates are always released and drained inside their widget-test zone. Existing queue, zone, child isolation and payload checks remain enforced.\n- [Fresh exact-head Feature run 43634307306](https://github.com/Ullmann27/lumo-lernen/actions/runs/43634307306) is pending completion. Studio promotion requires its actual successful gates.\n\nOriginal failures and independent reviews are retained in [evidence checkpoint 7e17a81d](https://github.com/Ullmann27/lumo-lernen/tree/7e17a81dafca7aa6bcac8f749ed7b5d444d72406/docs/evidence/root-correctness-checkpoint-20261114).\n\nThis draft targets development Studio; production Main is unchanged. A positive platform API acknowledgement is not a direct fsync guarantee, multi-engine CAS, physical Fold7 performance measurement or APK release approval.\n",
